9,Malagasy music and musical instruments: an alternative key to ...,https://www.academia.edu/6373986/Malagasy_music_and_musical_instruments_an_alternative_key_to_linguistic_and_cultural_history,"Madagascar's rich music and diverse musical instruments reveal significant insights into the island's linguistic and cultural history. By analyzing the polyphony of the Vazimba/Mikea and the impact of various cultures, including Austronesian, Arab, Bantu, and European, this research demonstrates how musical practices serve as a chronostratigraphic map, tracing back cultural influences and ...","Malagasy, Tanosy",Austronesian
